# my_engine: notes across the range, gate and release, every voice freed at the end.
# Scenario format: sim/README.md. Steps are sixteenth notes; `expect` lines make the test fail when they don't hold.
tempo 120
steps 16
tail 1.0
track lead
#      P1 P2  A   D   S  R  fx1 fx2 flt res pan lvl porta lfo... note style
preset  0  0  0  80 200  4  0   0   128 0   128 200 0     128 100 255 0 0
note 0  C2 2 100
note 4  C4 2 100
note 8  C6 2 100
note 12 A4 2 127
expect sound   0 2
expect silence 3.5 4      # release 4 is short: silence before the next note
expect sound   12 14
expect idle    18         # the envelope finished, the host freed every voice
expect peak_below -11.5   # -12 dBFS per voice at full velocity with the sub off (engine-abi.md rule 11)
